{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1636","id":4093496802,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87z_c3i","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1636","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1636.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1636.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1636","number":1636,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] add 249-question local VLM holdout evidence","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1635\n\nThis PR runs and records the required independent local-VLM holdout from exact base `de49902ad0e722ac75f56e8996c4ea7d9ef361be` (the merge of PR #1634).\n\nThe holdout contains 249 previously unseen official 9709 questions from 30 complete papers. It covers Papers 1-6 across March, May/June, and October/November sessions in 2023, 2024, and 2025, with proven zero overlap against the prior 213-question evaluation and repair population. Candidate-blind truth and complete page-chain evidence were frozen before the first candidate response.\n\nThe independent result is 221/249 first-pass exact match (88.755020%) and 242/249 final exact match (97.188755%). The seven residuals are classified as three normalization failures and four semantic/model disagreements. There were no terminal provider failures, no schema/protocol failures, no truth-adjudication findings, and no false mark-pass overrides. All inference used the local AI2-PC endpoint at concurrency 1 and cost CNY 0.\n\nThe run completed all 249 terminal outcomes and reconstructed compact artifacts byte-identically. The frozen replay validator then failed closed on three unnormalizable rows because it compares the stored warning list before replaying `terminal_status()`, which is the step that adds `full_pass_unnormalizable`. Raw candidates replay without mismatch and terminal statuses replay without mismatch. This PR does not repair or weaken that frozen validator; the exact finding is preserved in `deterministic-reconstruction-receipt.v1.json`, and the governance verdict remains fail-closed. Per #1635, exactly one bounded successor repair issue is justified only after independent review, merge, and exact-main readback.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1635_holdout.test.py` — 5 tests passed.\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1631_residual_repair.test.py` — 25 tests passed.\n- `python scripts/vlm/issue_1635_holdout.py validate --manifest-sha256 43ff57bab3f2611b82e8e875cef4a0e46a10bb2a258eef96d82f82e7d4c3da69` — PASS, 30 papers, 249 questions, zero overlap.\n- Frozen reconstruct command — expected fail-closed exit 1 at `terminal_evaluation_replay_mismatch_global_stop:9709_s23_qp_41_q07`.\n- All 12 checked-in JSON artifacts parse successfully; secret-exposure scan found zero matches.\n- Frozen runner, review, truth, and manifest hashes remained unchanged after inference.\n\nNo production, canonical dataset, public artifact, remote data-store, or paid/external VLM writes were performed.\n","created_at":"2026-07-20T18:20:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T18:44:40Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T18:42:32Z","merged_at":"2026-07-20T18:42:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"2d73d04d9739c991638651a4a6c049b2c705e6bf","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1636/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1636/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1636/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/427d237e793f1e57fd85572f2755b248edca4a80","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1635-local-vlm-holdout-200","ref":"task/1635-local-vlm-holdout-200","sha":"427d237e793f1e57fd85572f2755b248edca4a80","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":999357095,"node_id":"R_kgDOO5D6pw","name":"ciecopilot-home","full_name